Chest Logger CSV is an independent CSV replacement for ChestSee - Chestlogger.
Behavior was informed by the MIT-licensed ChestSee 26.2 source archive by
MafuuuX: https://modrinth.com/mod/chestsee-chestlogger/version/RmSO419a
ChestSee was inspired by Aguga2201's MIT-licensed ChestLogs:
https://github.com/Aguga2201/ChestLogs
The logging and action-tracking implementation has been rewritten for CSV.
This project is not an official ChestSee release.
